#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute has not met the minimum amount threshold set by the card "
"network based on the MCC.\n"
msgstr "该争议未达到卡组织根据 MCC 设定的最低金额门槛。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid as more than 35 total disputes have been submitted "
"within 120 calendar days of this dispute.\n"
msgstr "该争议无效，因为在该争议前后的 120 个日历日内提交的争议总数超过了 35 笔。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid as the transaction was unattended, chip-initiated, "
"and online authorized (e.g., swiping a chip card at an unattended gas pump, "
"parking meter, or ATM).\n"
"The liability is on the card provider for these types of transactions.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议无效，因为该交易为无人值守、芯片发起且在线授权的交易（例如在无人值守的"
"加油机、停车缴费机或 ATM 上挥卡）。\n"
"此类交易的责任由发卡机构承担。\n"
"该争议已被卡组织自动拒绝。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid because the merchant attempted 3DS for a Card-Not-"
"Present (CNP) transaction, but the card provider did not have 3DS enabled "
"for the card.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by the card network.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议无效，因为商户对无卡（CNP）交易尝试了 3DS，但发卡机构未为该卡片启用 3DS"
"。\n"
"该争议已被卡组织自动拒绝。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute is invalid since the transaction qualifies for Mastercard Easy "
"Payment Service (MEPS) Transaction, which allows businesses to accept "
"Mastercard without customers pausing to sign or enter a PIN.\n"
"With MEPS, the liability shifts onto the card provider.\n"
"The dispute was automatically rejected by Mastercard.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议无效，因为该交易符合万事达轻松支付服务（MEPS）交易的条件，该服务允许商"
"户受理万事达卡而无需客户停下来签名或输入 PIN 码。\n"
"使用 MEPS 时，责任转移给发卡机构。\n"
"该争议已被万事达自动拒绝。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute, created for Card-Not-Present fraud, is invalid because the "
"card network has indicated the cardholder was securely authenticated.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议因无卡欺诈而创建，但卡组织已表明持卡人通过了安全身份验证，因此该争议无"
"效。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute, created under Condition 10.4: Other Fraud, is invalid for an "
"ECI 5 Token Transaction where the Token Authentication Verification Value "
"(TAVV) was included in the Authorization Request.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议依据第 10.4 条「其他欺诈」创建，但对于授权请求中包含令牌验证值（TAVV）"
"的 ECI 5 令牌交易，该争议无效。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute, created under Condition 12.5: Incorrect Amount, has not met "
"the criteria set by Mastercard.\n"
"The dispute must include evidence of the correct amount.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议依据第 12.5 条「金额不正确」创建，但未满足万事达设定的标准。\n"
"该争议必须包含正确金额的证据。\n"

#. module: hr_expense_stripe
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense_stripe/models/hr_expense_stripe_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"This dispute, created under Condition 12.6: Duplicate Processing/Paid by "
"Other Means, has not met the criteria set by Mastercard.\n"
msgstr ""
"该争议依据第 12.6 条「重复处理/以其他方式支付」创建，但未满足万事达设定的标准"
"。\n"

